### Fitness platform — sample requests (VS Code "REST Client" or JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Run top to bottom. Paste ids/tokens into the variables below as you go.

@gateway = http://localhost:3000/api
@memberToken = <paste accessToken from register/login>
@adminToken = <paste accessToken of the admin>
@trainerToken = <paste accessToken of the trainer (log in AFTER promotion)>
@trainerId = <paste member id of the trainer>
@classId = <paste class id>
@bookingId = <paste booking id>

### Health of all services
GET http://localhost:3000/health/services

### Register a member
POST {{gateway}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@gym.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Lift",
  "membershipPlan": "basic"
}

### Register a future trainer
POST {{gateway}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bob@gym.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "firstName": "Bob",
  "lastName": "Burpee"
}

### Login (admin created via `npm run create-admin -w member-service -- admin@gym.com AdminPass123`)
POST {{gateway}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@gym.com", "password": "AdminPass123" }

### My profile
GET {{gateway}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Upgrade my plan  (emits member.updated)
PATCH {{gateway}}/members/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "membershipPlan": "premium" }

### Admin: promote Bob to trainer (emits member.updated → class-service trainers)
PATCH {{gateway}}/members/{{trainerId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role": "trainer" }

### Admin: list members
GET {{gateway}}/members?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Public: trainers (read model fed by Kafka)
GET {{gateway}}/trainers

### Trainer: schedule a class (emits class.scheduled)
POST {{gateway}}/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Morning HIIT",
  "description": "45 minutes of high intensity intervals",
  "category": "hiit",
  "room": "Studio A",
  "startsAt": "2030-01-15T07:00:00.000Z",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "capacity": 12
}

### Public: upcoming classes
GET {{gateway}}/classes?category=hiit

### Public: one class (bookedCount is updated from booking events)
GET {{gateway}}/classes/{{classId}}

### Member: book a class (emits booking.confirmed)
POST {{gateway}}/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "classId": "{{classId}}" }

### Member: my bookings
GET {{gateway}}/bookings/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Member: cancel a booking (emits booking.cancelled)
PATCH {{gateway}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}

### Trainer: class roster
GET {{gateway}}/bookings?classId={{classId}}&status=confirmed
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}

### Trainer: cancel the class (class.cancelled → bookings cancelled → booked_count reset)
PATCH {{gateway}}/classes/{{classId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{trainerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reason": "Trainer is sick" }
